{{!
    @template tool_vae/index_page

    The administration overview, below its heading: the link to the setup; then the error that the competencies are
    disabled, or the notice that no record is imported, or what is said of the records whose framework is gone (a warning,
    a warning and the table of the records that can be removed) and the table of the records; then the two buttons to
    import, side by side with nothing between them.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\index_page. The template holds no logic. The link
    is escaped (double braces). Eight keys are HTML (triple braces): errorhtml, nonehtml, warninghtml and removablehtml,
    notifications made by the core; tablehtml, a table drawn by the template tool_vae/table; sourceshtml, drawn by the
    template tool_vae/sources; primaryhtml and buttonhtml, buttons made by the core.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * setup - {url, label}: the link to the setup
    * errorhtml, nonehtml, warninghtml, removablehtml, tablehtml, sourceshtml - each false, or HTML
    * buttons - false, or {primaryhtml, buttonhtml}: the two buttons to import

    Example context (json):
    {
        "setup": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/setup.php", "label": "Getting started"},
        "errorhtml": false,
        "nonehtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\">No record imported.</div>",
        "warninghtml": false,
        "removablehtml": false,
        "tablehtml": false,
        "sourceshtml": false,
        "buttons": {"primaryhtml": "<div class=\"singlebutton\"><button type=\"submit\">Import records</button></div>",
            "buttonhtml": "<div class=\"singlebutton\"><button type=\"submit\">Import a file</button></div>"}
    }
}}
{{#setup}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/setup}}
{{#errorhtml}}
{{{errorhtml}}}
{{/errorhtml}}
{{#nonehtml}}
{{{nonehtml}}}
{{/nonehtml}}
{{#warninghtml}}
{{{warninghtml}}}
{{/warninghtml}}
{{#removablehtml}}
{{{removablehtml}}}
{{/removablehtml}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
{{#sourceshtml}}
{{{sourceshtml}}}
{{/sourceshtml}}
{{#buttons}}
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 tool-vae-import-buttons">{{{primaryhtml}}}{{{buttonhtml}}}</div>
{{/buttons}}
